** Probe: LOWWIND3 as a MODELOPT token without DFAULT, and the CO LOW_WIND
** card as pyaermod writes low_wind_option (LOW_WIND LOWWIND3). Setup pass only.
** AERMOD v26135 said: E203 for LOWWIND3 even without DFAULT, and E208
** (illegal numerical field) for LOW_WIND LOWWIND3: the card takes numbers.
CO STARTING
   TITLEONE  oracle 31d: low-wind options without DFAULT
   MODELOPT  CONC  ELEV  ALPHA  BETA  LOWWIND3
   AVERTIME  1
   POLLUTID  SO2
   LOW_WIND  LOWWIND3
   RUNORNOT  NOT
   ERRORFIL  31d_modelopt_lowwind_nondfault.err
CO FINISHED

SO STARTING
   LOCATION  STACK1  POINT  0.0  0.0  0.0
   SRCPARAM  STACK1  500.0  65.00  425.  15.0  5.
   SRCGROUP  ALL
SO FINISHED

RE STARTING
   DISCCART  500.  500.  0.  0.
RE FINISHED

ME STARTING
   SURFFILE  AERMET2.SFC
   PROFFILE  AERMET2.PFL
   SURFDATA  14735  1988  ALBANY,NY
   UAIRDATA  14735  1988  ALBANY,NY
   PROFBASE  0.0  METERS
ME FINISHED

OU STARTING
   RECTABLE  ALLAVE  FIRST
OU FINISHED
